WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:10.965
In this lesson, you will learn to plan a path to visit every gem and use a pick-up block at each one.

2
00:00:11.565 --> 00:00:17.583
Walk onto a gem, then use the pick-up block to collect it.

3
00:00:18.183 --> 00:00:21.157
Look at the map first.

4
00:00:21.157 --> 00:00:23.696
Which gem is closest?

5
00:00:23.696 --> 00:00:27.539
Plan a path that visits every gem.

6
00:00:28.139 --> 00:00:30.539
Count the gems.

7
00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:33.513
Did you collect them all?

8
00:00:34.113 --> 00:00:43.174
If the gems are in a row, a repeat can collect them: move, pick up — again and again!

9
00:00:43.774 --> 00:00:46.174
Collect both gems.

10
00:00:46.174 --> 00:00:49.148
Two gems in the bag!

11
00:00:49.748 --> 00:00:53.591
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

12
00:00:53.591 --> 00:00:58.739
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
